This directory exists so that the compose services and the documented
`docker run -v "$PWD/cases:/work"` have somewhere to mount.

If it did not exist, Docker would create it — owned by root, because the daemon
runs as root — and the container, which runs as uid 1000, could not write into
it. The run would fail with a permission error whose cause is several steps
removed from its message.

Simulation output written here is ignored by git.
